finiteness needed by the proof is the finite set of monomials of each degree. -/
theorem exists_degreewise_simultaneous_basis (m : MonomialOrder σ)
    (I : κ → Ideal (MvPolynomial σ R)) (G : κ → Set (MvPolynomial σ R))
    (hG : ∀ c, m.IsGroebnerBasis (G c) (I c))
